OL,3,GNEWSAScammers using AI-generated images
OL,4,Aof missing pets to demand reward money
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Stephanie Young's cat Buddy went
OL,7,Fmissing from her garden in September
OL,8,Flast year, she flooded pet rescue sites
OL,9,Fand social media groups with
OL,10,Finformation about him.
OL,12,FHer hopes were raised when an image of
OL,13,Fhim was sent through by a woman named
OL,14,FMelissa, who claimed to have fed her
OL,15,Fcat and wanted reward money for her
OL,16,Fautistic grandchildren.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
