OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F352A1793807763
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAScammers using AI-generated images
OL,4,Aof missing pets to demand reward money
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe foster carer from Birmingham was
OL,7,F"100% certain" she had found her cat
OL,8,Fand remembered thinking Buddy had
OL,9,Fpicked a lovely garden to sit in as she
OL,10,Fgot money out of the bank to pay for
OL,11,Fhis return.
OL,13,FWithin hours, she had agreed to meet
OL,14,FMelissa nearby to collect him, but the
OL,15,Findividual never turned up, refused a
OL,16,Fcash payment and pushed for 100 Apple
OL,17,Fgift cards as a reward.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
